{"version":"V28.33-reorder-sync-no-drag","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T06:30:00.000Z","note":"V28.33 Finger-dragging of blocks on the schematic is removed. Reordering is now done with semi-transparent buttons on the GOST diagram: ▲▼ on the input (main) apparatus chain, ◀▶ on each group (groups sit side by side), ◀▶ on each line inside a group. These buttons reorder the actual data, so the diagram and the manual selection form stay in sync both ways (reorder on the diagram = reordered in the form, and vice versa). Two-finger pinch zoom and one-finger pan are kept for viewing. The form chips keep their ◀▶ and ⠿ drag."}
